; One thrown tongue. No collision shape: FlamePuff tests its own hit radius against the enemies
; group, so the shape that burns and the shape that is drawn are one number rather than two that
; drift. The strip is five frames at speed 10, i.e. half a second at SpeedScale 1 - FlamePuff
; rescales that to its own lifetime so the flame is always out exactly when it stops hurting.
[node name="FlamePuff" type="Node2D"]
script = ExtResource("1")
Speed = 340.0
Lifetime = 0.42
HitRadius = 20.0
AuthoredStripSeconds = 0.5

